+## #2411 - Map the DXF profile MCP suite to its app modules
+
+**Decided:** Add `app::mcp`, `app::tool_profile_dxf`, and `app::commands` to
+the suite's Gate map header. Add a selection pin for each module in the
+existing xtask test module.
+
+**Why:** The missing header fails the xtask gate. The map also lets the
+quick gate select `tool_dxf_profile_mcp` when these modules change.
+
+**Dropped:** Do not weaken the Gate map rule or exempt this suite. Either
+choice would hide missing coverage. Runtime changes are unnecessary.
+
+**Cost to change later:** Update the header and selection pin if the
+covered modules move.
diff --git a/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs b/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
index e99186d94..f50e1fb76 100644
--- a/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
+++ b/xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs
@@ -31,6 +31,19 @@ fn count(file: &str, krate: &str) -> usize {
     selected(file, krate).len()
 }
 
+/// #2411: the DXF profile MCP suite must run when its app entry points change.
+#[test]
+fn tool_dxf_profile_mcp_is_selected_for_its_app_entry_points() {
+    for file in [
+        "crates/app/src/mcp/mod.rs",
+        "crates/app/src/tool_profile_dxf.rs",
+        "crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs",
+    ] {
+        let got = selected(file, "app");
+        assert!(got.iter().any(|b| b == "tool_dxf_profile_mcp"), "{file}: DXF profile MCP suite missing from {got:?}");
+    }
+}
